OL,3,AElon Musk confirms he is considering
OL,4,Amerging Tesla and SpaceX
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk has said he is actively
OL,7,Fconsidering merging Tesla and SpaceX,
OL,8,Fhis two biggest companies.
OL,10,F"Do I think it would be a good idea?
OL,11,FYes," Musk said during a call with
OL,12,Ffinancial analysts to discuss SpaceX's
OL,13,Flatest results on Tuesday.
OL,15,FWhile Musk noted it could not be
OL,16,Fassumed a merger will go ahead, and it
OL,17,Fwould need shareholders' support, he
OL,18,Fsaid special committees within both
OL,19,Fcompanies had been formed to examine
OL,20,Fthe move.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,117,105,200,160,0,100
